<h2 id="glossary">Glossary</h2>
<ul>
<li><strong>BOM</strong> — bill of materials</li>
<li><strong>Pilot</strong> — real-environment trial with real users</li>
<li><strong>IP rating</strong> — ingress protection (dust/water)</li>
<li><strong>Conformal coating</strong> — protective PCB film</li>
<li><strong>Burn-in</strong> — powered stress test catching early failures</li>
<li><strong>Device twin</strong> — cloud record of device state</li>
<li><strong>Staged rollout</strong> — gradual update deployment</li>
<li><strong>TCO</strong> — total cost of ownership</li>
<li><strong>RMA</strong> — return merchandise authorization</li>
<li><strong>Derating</strong> — adjusting specs for real conditions</li>
<li><strong>Pogo-pin fixture</strong> — production programming/test rig</li>
</ul>
<hr />
<h2 id="practice-exercises">Practice Exercises</h2>
<ol>
<li>For your project, write the three stage-questions (prototype/pilot/production) and what would answer each.</li>
<li>Your outdoor node fails in month 2. List five likely causes in order and how you'd diagnose each remotely.</li>
<li>Size a solar system for a node averaging 2 mW in your region's worst month. Show math.</li>
<li>Plan gateway placement for 40 LoRa nodes over 3 km² of farmland. What survey would you run?</li>
<li>Design a production test fixture: what does it check, in what order, with what pass/fail criteria?</li>
<li>Write the provisioning flow for 1,000 devices, including the audit trail.</li>
<li>Your fleet dashboard shows 5% of devices offline. Write the triage runbook.</li>
<li>Build a 5-year TCO model for 2,000 units of a device you specify. What's the BOM multiple?</li>
<li>Write pilot success criteria (5 items, numeric) for an air-quality deployment in schools.</li>
<li>Outline a deployment experience paper for a pilot you could run, with the failures section pre-structured.</li>
</ol>
